OL,3,GNEWSAFamily worried over rig survivor
OL,4,Astuck in Gabon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Briton who survived the sinking of a
OL,7,Fdrilling rig off the west coast of
OL,8,FAfrica which left four dead and a fifth
OL,9,Fperson missing is still not able to
OL,10,Freturn home more than three weeks after
OL,11,Fthe disaster, it is claimed.
OL,13,FRichard Richardson, 68, from Hull,
OL,14,Fescaped with only the clothes he was
OL,15,Fwearing and a few euros when Prospector
OL,16,F5 sank off Mayumba, Gabon, on 24
OL,17,FOctober.
OL,19,FHe has been staying at a secure hotel
OL,20,Fcomplex since the disaster ` but he is
OL,21,Fnot free to leave, according to his
OL,22,Ffamily.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
